WEBVTT

01:07.112 --> 01:09.184
Your heel snapped off?

01:09.184 --> 01:10.532
It did.

01:10.532 --> 01:12.788
You work for Director Oh, correct?

01:14.411 --> 01:16.663
What's your shoe size?
We're wearing the exact same pair.

01:24.809 --> 01:27.387
[2022 Haemu Group Regular Board Meeting]

01:30.427 --> 01:33.142
It turns out the human heart

01:33.142 --> 01:35.027
can be incredibly fickle.

01:36.234 --> 01:38.769
I felt genuinely thankful earlier,

01:52.600 --> 01:55.100
but realizing she had the designer pair

01:55.100 --> 01:58.538
while I wore a knockoff

01:58.538 --> 02:01.582
left a bitter taste in my mouth.

02:12.802 --> 02:14.930
- Good morning.
- Right, hi.

02:14.930 --> 02:18.194
Is Joo In Ah out of the office today?

02:18.194 --> 02:19.810
She took an overseas assignment,

02:19.810 --> 02:22.080
so she won't be back in Korea
for quite some time.

02:28.176 --> 02:31.385
What exactly went through her mind

02:32.392 --> 02:35.158
as she walked away with my counterfeit shoe?

02:35.158 --> 02:37.285
Finance just sent this up,

02:37.285 --> 02:39.309
and since it's a standard routine expense,

02:39.309 --> 02:41.456
a quick review should be more than enough.

02:41.456 --> 02:42.832
I'll take a closer look anyway,

02:42.832 --> 02:45.975
because a routine expense doesn't
automatically mean it's correct.

02:45.975 --> 02:47.174
Understood.

02:49.333 --> 02:51.768
You can use this pen to sign...

03:06.731 --> 03:08.338
Those are lovely shoes.

03:09.559 --> 03:10.854
Excuse me?

03:13.864 --> 03:15.518
Never mind.

03:15.518 --> 03:17.559
Back then,

03:17.559 --> 03:20.434
had I realized the true meaning
behind that moment,

03:20.434 --> 03:23.097
I never would have let it begin.

03:26.351 --> 03:29.729
People always say profound love
closely resembles intense hatred.

03:31.184 --> 03:33.858
[Exposing the Private Life of Head Joo In Ah]
Am I truly in love with Jeon Jae Yeol?

03:34.509 --> 03:36.843
Or is this just my pure hatred for Joo In Ah?

03:44.269 --> 03:45.272
[Send]

03:46.021 --> 03:48.499
[Email sent successfully]

03:51.651 --> 03:55.864
[Episode 10: Irreversible]

03:55.864 --> 03:56.906
[To Assistant Manager Lee Jae Han of PR Team 2]

03:56.906 --> 03:57.949
[To Assistant Manager Oh Jae Hoon
of Haemu Pharma]

03:57.949 --> 03:58.954
[To Assistant Manager Kim Hye Mi of HR Team 3]

04:03.470 --> 04:05.123
Is this actually true about Head Joo?

04:05.123 --> 04:06.690
What's the mood like in your office right now?

04:06.690 --> 04:08.767
Have you heard any inside details?

04:44.662 --> 04:46.709
[Are you okay?]

04:57.968 --> 04:59.271
Yeah.

05:01.137 --> 05:02.904
That's right.

05:05.576 --> 05:07.193
Understood.

05:12.392 --> 05:13.900
I'm completely fine,

05:13.900 --> 05:16.115
but the upper management clearly isn't.

05:18.113 --> 05:20.172
I need to head upstairs for a minute.

05:22.075 --> 05:25.678
[Head of Audit]

05:36.131 --> 05:40.427
It looks like everyone has plenty to discuss,

05:40.427 --> 05:43.486
and typing on the messenger
gets exhausting, doesn't it?

05:43.486 --> 05:45.306
While I step out for this meeting,

05:45.306 --> 05:47.757
feel free to use your actual voices

05:47.757 --> 05:51.017
and chat as much as you want.

05:51.017 --> 05:53.307
But once I return,

05:53.307 --> 05:55.885
you're going straight back to focusing on work,

05:57.809 --> 05:59.088
are we clear?

06:09.289 --> 06:11.489
[J Care Hospital]

06:16.193 --> 06:18.051
Is the show really that entertaining?

06:21.476 --> 06:22.886
Your own son came to visit,

06:22.886 --> 06:25.653
yet you've been staring
at the screen for hours.

06:50.747 --> 06:54.301
[Missed call]

07:00.340 --> 07:03.426
[A tip about Head of Audit Joo In Ah]

07:03.426 --> 07:06.320
[Attached is the photo
of the married boss and Head Joo]

07:07.153 --> 07:09.224
How does it make any sense

07:09.224 --> 07:11.559
for the Head of Audit to face
these kinds of allegations?

07:11.559 --> 07:12.914
Allegations?

07:12.914 --> 07:14.771
That's nothing but a completely baseless claim
from an anonymous sender.

07:14.771 --> 07:17.858
We have photographic evidence
staring right at us.

07:17.858 --> 07:20.569
What exactly is going on here?

07:20.569 --> 07:23.493
It's just a friendly greeting between friends.

07:23.493 --> 07:26.700
We aren't in the States.
Nobody says hello with a full embrace here.

07:26.700 --> 07:30.778
That's an incredibly outdated way
to look at things...

07:30.778 --> 07:33.827
All right, let's cut to the chase here.

07:33.827 --> 07:35.208
Who exactly is the mystery man

07:35.208 --> 07:38.727
getting so friendly in that photo?

07:50.476 --> 07:51.974
Brother!

07:59.849 --> 08:01.761
It's certainly been a minute.

08:01.761 --> 08:03.505
I believe you're sitting in my chair.

08:19.975 --> 08:23.298
Did you guys convene a disciplinary committee
for Head Joo In Ah?

08:23.298 --> 08:24.882
That isn't what this is.

08:24.882 --> 08:27.267
So our top executives are sitting around
over some spam email

08:27.267 --> 08:30.092
just to gang up on one employee?

08:35.034 --> 08:36.818
Do none of you have actual work to do?

08:37.695 --> 08:39.936
This situation completely justifies
an emergency meeting

08:39.936 --> 08:42.958
when the entire company is in absolute chaos.

08:43.850 --> 08:46.863
Gathering all these executives over a single,

08:46.863 --> 08:49.866
vaguely worded malicious email,

08:49.866 --> 08:51.642
don't you find that slightly laughable?

08:51.642 --> 08:53.536
This is a direct report

08:53.536 --> 08:56.175
regarding nobody else but the Head of Audit.

08:56.175 --> 08:58.016
Aren't you the one playing favorites

08:58.016 --> 09:00.967
just because you happen to like her?

09:10.929 --> 09:13.467
Call the Head of HR into this room,
right this second.

09:17.811 --> 09:19.855
Your timing is impeccable,

09:19.855 --> 09:21.856
staying out of sight for days,

09:21.856 --> 09:25.560
only to swoop in the exact moment
Head Joo lands in trouble.

09:27.968 --> 09:31.616
I'm just thrilled to have you back.

09:31.616 --> 09:34.107
I'll call HR immediately.

09:37.622 --> 09:41.481
We confirmed the email went out
to every single employee at HQ.

09:41.481 --> 09:43.059
Internal searches for Head Joo

09:43.059 --> 09:46.130
and the male executives have spiked
dramatically across the board,

09:46.130 --> 09:49.639
undoubtedly because of this incident.

09:50.635 --> 09:52.429
Head Bu,

09:52.429 --> 09:55.515
regarding these public posts
about a person's private life...

09:55.515 --> 09:57.667
Go ahead, Vice Chairman.

09:57.667 --> 10:01.184
Submitting a formal complaint
to Audit through proper channels

10:01.184 --> 10:03.226
would be perfectly fine,

10:03.226 --> 10:05.857
but an indiscriminate
public smear campaign like this

10:05.857 --> 10:09.100
definitely crosses into legal trouble,

10:09.100 --> 10:10.565
does it not?

10:11.490 --> 10:13.116
Oh, absolutely.

10:13.116 --> 10:15.618
Since it was broadcast company-wide,

10:15.618 --> 10:17.892
regardless of whether the claims
are actually true,

10:17.892 --> 10:21.037
it opens up massive grounds
for a defamation lawsuit.

10:21.037 --> 10:24.585
Furthermore, an external email
reaching the entire staff

10:24.585 --> 10:27.506
strongly suggests
our employee directory was leaked,

10:27.506 --> 10:31.965
making a sender trace an absolute necessity
from a security standpoint.

10:31.965 --> 10:34.637
Right away, I'll have the HR Information Office

10:34.637 --> 10:36.266
initiate a trace immediately.

10:36.266 --> 10:38.183
Keep me posted the second you get any results.

10:38.183 --> 10:39.723
Consider it done, Vice Chairman.

11:04.334 --> 11:07.043
Heading out for the day, Head Joo?

11:11.100 --> 11:13.622
Is the food to your liking?

11:15.345 --> 11:16.644
Absolutely.

11:16.644 --> 11:18.622
We Koreans definitely run on a good meal.

11:20.475 --> 11:22.293
You certainly have a great smile.

11:23.060 --> 11:25.730
So why did you look so miserable in that photo?

11:25.730 --> 11:28.176
I thought you were sharing a joyful greeting.

11:29.524 --> 11:31.444
Looking at a split-second photograph

11:31.444 --> 11:34.043
and making rash judgments
is never a smart move.

11:35.490 --> 11:38.452
I'm entirely free
to make whatever judgment I please,

11:38.452 --> 11:40.592
considering my position in this company.

11:42.038 --> 11:45.567
Whether this whole mess blows over
as a minor glitch

11:46.250 --> 11:48.837
or explodes into a full-blown scandal

11:48.837 --> 11:51.606
depends entirely on the call made right here.

11:56.392 --> 11:59.890
I've kept a very close eye on you.

11:59.890 --> 12:01.725
Judging by the last executive workshop,

12:01.725 --> 12:03.768
you refuse to take my side,

12:03.768 --> 12:06.731
yet you don't seem to belong
to my brother either.

12:07.867 --> 12:12.376
Don't you think it's time
to clearly pick a lane?

12:17.059 --> 12:18.783
If I take a sip of this,

12:18.783 --> 12:22.828
does it legally bind us
in some sort of blood oath?

12:22.828 --> 12:24.080
I'd be absolutely thrilled

12:24.080 --> 12:26.176
to gain a big sister exactly like you.

12:29.642 --> 12:32.100
If you truly see me as your older sister,

12:32.100 --> 12:34.898
you probably shouldn't
be threatening me like this.

12:36.592 --> 12:38.498
Oh, you interpreted that as a threat.

12:38.498 --> 12:40.303
What a shame,

12:40.303 --> 12:42.598
as I meant it as a generous proposal.

12:42.598 --> 12:44.366
In that case,

12:45.644 --> 12:48.642
you leave me no choice but to reject
your generous proposal.

12:50.142 --> 12:52.901
Such a pity to waste good liquor,

12:52.901 --> 12:56.628
but I'll cover the dinner bill
instead to make up for it.

13:10.090 --> 13:14.418
She clearly thinks I'm a complete joke.

13:32.231 --> 13:35.276
[Head of Audit]

13:35.276 --> 13:36.946
[Joo In Ah]

13:36.946 --> 13:38.822
What exactly is going on here?

13:38.822 --> 13:40.881
Apologies for the intrusion, Head Joo.

13:44.410 --> 13:45.912
What on earth do you think you're doing?

13:45.912 --> 13:48.647
Back off immediately.
This desk belongs to the Head of Audit.

13:49.559 --> 13:53.476
Our company policy clearly delegates
this kind of search to Audit,

13:53.476 --> 13:55.639
so this is truly a creative approach.

13:55.639 --> 13:57.506
Vice Chairman Jeon Seong Yeol ordered

13:57.506 --> 14:01.759
a full-scale investigation
regarding this recent email leak.

14:01.759 --> 14:04.764
Since you're directly involved in the incident,

14:04.764 --> 14:08.617
his office is personally
taking over the inquiry.

14:27.579 --> 14:29.088
What's the meaning of all this?

14:29.934 --> 14:33.759
Let's just say
I'm the latest casualty of office politics.

14:34.565 --> 14:36.838
Vice Chairman Jeon Seong Yeol
officially has it out for me.

14:36.838 --> 14:38.297
He promised to make my life miserable over this

14:38.297 --> 14:40.978
unless I join his camp,

14:40.978 --> 14:42.791
and I naturally told him no.

14:45.434 --> 14:47.900
Relax your face before you give
yourself permanent wrinkles.

14:50.767 --> 14:53.384
You realize you're purely
in the political arena now, right?

14:53.384 --> 14:56.565
Logic and hard facts are
completely useless at this stage, so...

14:56.565 --> 14:57.984
just hold your ground.

14:57.984 --> 15:00.434
If holding out stops working...

15:00.434 --> 15:02.364
if it comes down to that,

15:02.364 --> 15:03.931
then...

15:05.226 --> 15:06.572
Then what?

15:08.642 --> 15:12.066
You plan to swoop in like a knight
in shining armor and carry me off?

15:12.066 --> 15:13.849
Would you want me to?

15:15.084 --> 15:18.017
I'm actually terrified
you might do exactly that.

15:18.017 --> 15:19.046
Don't worry about me.

15:19.046 --> 15:22.049
I've survived the corporate grind for years,

15:22.049 --> 15:24.155
so if they want to play dirty,

15:24.155 --> 15:27.533
I'm more than ready to pull out
some strategic moves of my own.

15:28.389 --> 15:29.915
What exactly is the game plan here?

15:30.808 --> 15:34.103
You claimed the two of you were
merely sharing a greeting, correct?

15:34.103 --> 15:36.084
That is exactly what I said.

15:37.524 --> 15:40.610
Then take another close look at this photograph

15:40.610 --> 15:42.155
and explicitly identify

15:42.155 --> 15:44.173
the person you were greeting.

15:49.809 --> 15:51.986
Well, let me think.

15:52.809 --> 15:54.331
Who could this possibly be?

15:54.331 --> 15:56.725
Are you seriously claiming you have zero memory

15:56.725 --> 15:58.502
of someone you embraced that intimately?

15:58.502 --> 16:01.422
It's less about forgetting

16:01.422 --> 16:04.341
and more about sheer volume

16:04.341 --> 16:06.934
making it hard to tell them apart.

16:06.934 --> 16:09.870
I had just moved back from overseas back then,

16:09.870 --> 16:12.391
so my default greeting for everyone was,

16:12.391 --> 16:14.978
let's say, a lot more Westernized.

16:14.978 --> 16:16.062
You know how it is.

16:16.062 --> 16:18.189
That kind of embrace is
standard practice over there,

16:18.189 --> 16:20.609
and since I was so used to it,

16:20.609 --> 16:23.587
getting my brain reprogrammed
to traditional Korean manners took some time.

16:26.281 --> 16:27.991
Are you actively trying

16:27.991 --> 16:30.274
to make a fool out of me?

16:32.119 --> 16:35.277
Nice try,

16:35.277 --> 16:36.957
Mr. Kim Deok Chul,

16:36.957 --> 16:39.976
but true intimidation requires...

16:42.559 --> 16:44.950
the right sound effects to back it up.

16:46.600 --> 16:48.360
Exactly like this.

16:55.719 --> 16:58.591
Do you think Head Joo is holding up okay?

16:59.647 --> 17:02.353
The Vice Chairman's team doesn't mess around,

17:02.353 --> 17:05.195
and I'm worried someone with her pride
might crack under the pressure.

17:05.195 --> 17:06.725
Seriously,

17:06.725 --> 17:09.079
am I the only person struggling
to wrap my head around this?

17:09.079 --> 17:10.866
Executive office or not,

17:10.866 --> 17:13.495
has there ever been a single precedent
of a rogue investigation like this?

17:13.495 --> 17:15.079
If they genuinely needed an inquiry,

17:15.079 --> 17:16.580
they should have assembled
an official task force

17:16.580 --> 17:18.875
and strictly followed protocol, by the book.

17:18.875 --> 17:21.720
Vice Chairman's office or not,
they completely crossed a massive line...

17:28.895 --> 17:32.395
like, a really massive line.

17:32.395 --> 17:35.599
Seeing our famously cool-headed Ki Jun
get this worked up

17:35.599 --> 17:37.519
proves exactly how insane this whole thing is.

17:37.519 --> 17:39.635
The whole setup feels extremely sketchy.

17:39.635 --> 17:42.320
The email itself was super vague,

17:42.320 --> 17:43.725
practically just a cheap shot,

17:43.725 --> 17:46.365
so flipping the entire company
upside down over it feels excessive.

17:50.100 --> 17:52.116
So what's the plan?

17:52.116 --> 17:53.826
Please tell me you aren't
planning another mass protest

17:53.826 --> 17:55.744
like we did for Mr. Moo.

17:55.744 --> 17:59.140
Come on,
this is an entirely different ballgame.

17:59.140 --> 18:01.710
You can smell the executive-level
political warfare from a mile away,

18:01.710 --> 18:03.919
so sticking our necks out will
accomplish absolutely nothing

18:03.919 --> 18:06.061
except getting us crushed in the crossfire.

18:06.061 --> 18:07.518
Even so,

18:07.518 --> 18:10.176
sitting on my hands and doing nothing
feels fundamentally wrong.

18:10.176 --> 18:12.011
Man, is there any way

18:12.011 --> 18:14.555
we can safely pass along a message?

18:14.555 --> 18:16.059
Just a quiet signal letting Head Joo know

18:16.059 --> 18:19.026
we have her back unconditionally.

18:23.672 --> 18:25.917
I will catch you guys tomorrow, then.

18:36.100 --> 18:37.693
Wait, what brings everyone down here...

18:37.693 --> 18:40.592
Are you feeling hungry at all?

18:40.592 --> 18:43.830
Let's head out for a good meal together.

18:49.642 --> 18:51.142
Well look at this, our Hae Young

18:51.142 --> 18:53.611
is going all out
with a steamed snow crab feast.

18:53.611 --> 18:54.636
You said it.

18:54.636 --> 18:57.614
Being in season definitely makes the meat
plump and incredibly tasty.

18:58.434 --> 19:01.309
The meat on these legs is incredibly thick.
You should take a bite right away.

19:01.309 --> 19:02.683
The head actually beats the legs.

19:02.683 --> 19:04.300
Dipping it lightly in ssamjang
makes it even better.

19:04.300 --> 19:05.314
Here is some water...

19:05.314 --> 19:06.351
Try it with the salad.

19:06.351 --> 19:08.609
- Try it with this on top.
- You should try the crab paste.

19:08.609 --> 19:10.417
What is going on with everyone?

19:11.180 --> 19:13.697
I thought I walked into my own birthday party.

19:13.697 --> 19:15.488
Should I do a doljabi or something?

19:16.784 --> 19:18.260
No.

19:20.253 --> 19:22.017
I know you guys set up this dinner

19:22.017 --> 19:24.351
just to cheer me up.

19:26.100 --> 19:27.734
I'm genuinely touched.

19:28.712 --> 19:30.381
Look,

19:30.381 --> 19:32.216
you're...

19:32.216 --> 19:34.552
our protective fence,

19:34.552 --> 19:37.554
and we can only stay safe
if that fence stays standing.

19:37.554 --> 19:41.141
I thought you weren't planning to stay long?

19:41.141 --> 19:43.412
Guess he plans to milk this place for years.

19:43.412 --> 19:45.562
Why would you say it like that?

19:45.562 --> 19:46.892
That's not it at all.

19:46.892 --> 19:49.191
My kids are young,

19:49.191 --> 19:50.818
and who knows if I can...

19:50.818 --> 19:53.206
but I need to buy a house in Seoul.

19:53.206 --> 19:55.991
I have my own reasons for living like this.

19:55.991 --> 19:58.267
My wife only gives me

19:58.267 --> 19:59.743
a measly 200,000 won for my monthly allowance.

19:59.743 --> 20:01.710
- 200,000 won?
- Yeah.

20:01.710 --> 20:04.169
That's the heavy burden of a provider.

20:04.169 --> 20:06.500
I'll be glued to this company

20:06.500 --> 20:08.610
until my twins go off to college.

20:08.610 --> 20:10.249
Naturally.

20:10.249 --> 20:13.632
Supporting your boyfriend must be tough, right?

20:13.632 --> 20:15.718
No, it's really not that bad.

20:15.718 --> 20:17.845
Oh, are you seeing someone?

20:17.845 --> 20:20.389
Yeah. We've just been dating for ten years.

20:20.389 --> 20:22.887
Wait, are you still seeing that musician?

20:22.887 --> 20:25.934
I told you to date a golfer, not a guitarist.

20:25.934 --> 20:27.347
You should stop right now

20:27.347 --> 20:28.522
before I decide to punch you.

20:28.522 --> 20:30.692
When have you ever not wanted to?

20:30.692 --> 20:32.194
What about you, Da Ye?

20:32.194 --> 20:33.767
You're young with a great resume.

20:33.767 --> 20:35.127
Aren't you planning to jump ship?

20:35.127 --> 20:36.500
No.

20:38.032 --> 20:41.055
All companies seem pretty much the same,

20:42.767 --> 20:44.375
and besides...

20:44.375 --> 20:46.328
I actually like this team.

20:49.975 --> 20:51.821
What did you just say?

20:53.339 --> 20:55.485
I said I like this team.

20:56.683 --> 20:59.617
My heart just fluttered, is it just me?

20:59.617 --> 21:00.637
Me too.

21:00.637 --> 21:02.682
Hearing that from someone like you

21:02.682 --> 21:04.951
makes it feel that much more touching.

21:08.017 --> 21:09.481
Great.

21:09.481 --> 21:11.774
I'll take Team 3's support

21:11.774 --> 21:14.518
and use it to push myself harder.

21:14.518 --> 21:15.701
Yes.

21:16.822 --> 21:18.809
I'll be your sturdy fence.

21:18.809 --> 21:21.892
No, your brick wall, your retaining wall,

21:21.892 --> 21:25.372
your Suwon Hwaseong, your ironclad fortress.
Let's go!

21:25.372 --> 21:27.267
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

21:27.267 --> 21:29.090
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

21:29.090 --> 21:30.919
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

21:30.919 --> 21:32.686
That sounds super reassuring.

21:36.090 --> 21:37.523
Awesome.

21:37.523 --> 21:38.531
Enjoy the food, everyone.

21:38.531 --> 21:40.030
- Will do.
- Thank you.

21:47.892 --> 21:51.438
- It's great.
- Hey, Hae Young.

21:51.438 --> 21:53.696
You know...

21:53.696 --> 21:55.819
That looks great.

21:55.819 --> 21:59.029
The Vice Chairman does own a studio apartment,

21:59.029 --> 22:00.809
but there are no signs of anyone living there,

22:00.809 --> 22:02.951
and he doesn't seem to visit often either.

22:02.951 --> 22:04.402
A studio apartment?

22:05.059 --> 22:09.521
But he did visit
this mixed-use complex sometimes.

22:09.521 --> 22:11.683
I checked to see whose place it was...

22:15.309 --> 22:17.660
- It belongs to a coworker...
- I know exactly who it is.

22:19.258 --> 22:20.773
Joo In Ah.

22:23.430 --> 22:25.724
Why would he go to Joo In Ah's place?

22:25.724 --> 22:27.802
What are you doing?

22:27.802 --> 22:29.852
Oh, come on.

22:29.852 --> 22:33.642
Who is Jia to get a limited-edition Serpe ring?

22:33.642 --> 22:36.026
And why bring it into our marital home?

22:36.026 --> 22:37.828
Is Jia your true love?

22:40.100 --> 22:41.813
Oh, wait a second.

23:24.518 --> 23:25.967
So...

23:26.975 --> 23:29.404
It wasn't Jia, but Joo In Ah?

23:30.539 --> 23:32.790
From the very beginning up until now.

23:36.767 --> 23:37.796
Good work.

23:37.796 --> 23:39.079
Thank you.

24:17.220 --> 24:18.809
Da Ye.

24:18.809 --> 24:20.485
Do you have anything to say to me?

24:27.059 --> 24:28.321
I don't.

24:32.893 --> 24:34.204
What is it?

24:39.483 --> 24:41.813
This is Noh Ki Jun from Audit Team 3.

24:42.719 --> 24:43.745
What is it?

24:43.745 --> 24:45.493
What, what happened?

24:47.365 --> 24:50.075
I know I shouldn't be doing this,

24:50.075 --> 24:52.741
but none of it adds up so I came over.

24:55.916 --> 24:58.142
That email about Joo In Ah,

24:58.142 --> 25:00.127
our team traced the sender on it.

25:00.127 --> 25:01.420
So, who was it?

25:01.420 --> 25:03.334
Who would send something like that?

25:04.476 --> 25:06.092
You.

25:06.092 --> 25:08.522
- What?
- The IP address of the sender

25:08.522 --> 25:10.920
came back to your apartment.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.663
I just couldn't wrap my head around it.

25:13.440 --> 25:15.060
Hey man, come on.

25:15.060 --> 25:17.226
Did you have a grudge against Joo In Ah?

25:17.226 --> 25:19.771
Because she demoted you to PM?

25:21.233 --> 25:22.685
Hold on a second.

25:27.351 --> 25:29.282
The email was sent

25:29.282 --> 25:33.301
from the residence
of Assistant Manager Noh Ki Jun in Audit.

25:42.236 --> 25:44.208
It is time for you to head out.

26:13.492 --> 26:16.662
[Noh Ki Jun]

26:26.129 --> 26:28.800
Before tomorrow afternoon's conference,

26:28.800 --> 26:30.927
you have lunch with Executive Hwang,

26:30.927 --> 26:32.747
but the route is a bit tangled.

26:33.414 --> 26:36.504
Should I check in
with their side about the location again?

26:41.144 --> 26:44.465
[Noh Ki Jun]

26:47.859 --> 26:49.332
Just answer it.

26:50.195 --> 26:51.321
No need,

26:51.321 --> 26:52.652
I'll call back later.

26:54.157 --> 26:56.878
Looks like a call you ought to take now.

26:58.954 --> 27:02.042
[Noh Ki Jun]

27:03.333 --> 27:05.753
Hey, what's going on?

27:05.753 --> 27:07.755
Where are you? We need to talk.

27:07.755 --> 27:09.132
This isn't a good time,

27:09.132 --> 27:10.777
- can we...
- Don't tell me it was you?

27:11.468 --> 27:14.846
The IP behind the email about the Head
came back to my place.

27:14.846 --> 27:16.723
Was it really you?

27:16.723 --> 27:19.392
That first anonymous tip you sent to me,

27:19.392 --> 27:20.936
that was you too, wasn't it?

27:20.936 --> 27:24.006
Park Ah Jeong, what were you even thinking...

27:50.244 --> 27:52.008
Why did you do this?

27:52.008 --> 27:53.834
So how did it look?

27:53.834 --> 27:56.660
The sight of them together,

27:56.660 --> 28:00.015
did it still feel special,
even from the outside looking in?

28:00.015 --> 28:02.310
- What?
- I wanted to show you something.

28:02.310 --> 28:05.809
That love you hold up as something so pure

28:05.809 --> 28:08.267
is no different from the feelings of mine

28:08.267 --> 28:09.734
that you brush off and look down on.

28:09.734 --> 28:12.840
If your anger was with me,
you should have come at me.

28:12.840 --> 28:15.708
- Why drag In Ah into...
- What is so special about that woman?

28:16.653 --> 28:19.443
Am I invisible to you, right here next to you?

28:19.443 --> 28:22.270
Why does Joo In Ah get to count when I don't?

28:30.392 --> 28:32.739
This is where it ends with you.

28:34.243 --> 28:36.267
Park Ah Jeong,

28:36.267 --> 28:37.919
you're fired.

28:40.518 --> 28:43.642
Am I really nothing to you?

28:43.642 --> 28:45.661
Whatever it was before, it isn't anymore.

28:48.690 --> 28:50.706
I was wrong.

28:51.518 --> 28:53.709
It's me though.

28:54.518 --> 28:57.820
I was always the one who had eyes only for you.

28:57.820 --> 29:00.786
You kept pushing my feelings aside
like they meant nothing,

29:00.786 --> 29:03.702
so I felt cornered and furious,
and that's why I did it.

29:04.980 --> 29:07.595
I know I messed up, please.

29:09.892 --> 29:12.322
Please don't throw me away.

29:43.555 --> 29:45.799
Good morning, Head Joo.

29:46.788 --> 29:49.416
A Vice Chairman as busy as you are,

29:49.416 --> 29:51.588
what brings you down here in person?

29:55.627 --> 29:57.309
I knew it.

29:57.309 --> 29:59.177
You don't get to be Head of Audit for nothing.

29:59.177 --> 30:02.385
My guys completely threw in
the towel against you.

30:03.388 --> 30:04.885
Is that so?

30:05.724 --> 30:08.854
You seem to be holding up just fine,

30:08.854 --> 30:10.029
but I happen to know

30:10.029 --> 30:12.987
one last interview trick
that breaks down people like you.

30:14.226 --> 30:15.807
Finding the weak spot.

30:17.068 --> 30:18.934
A weak spot of mine.

30:18.934 --> 30:21.838
It won't be easy for you to pin one down.

30:24.683 --> 30:26.850
I hear you wrapped up yesterday's interview

30:26.850 --> 30:29.167
with a nice dinner with Audit Team 3.

30:29.838 --> 30:31.585
What did you have?

30:31.585 --> 30:34.779
These days, meat for company dinners
feels played out, doesn't it?

30:37.683 --> 30:39.810
What is it you're trying to say?

30:39.810 --> 30:42.927
Heard the mood with you was all warm and cozy,

30:42.927 --> 30:44.809
so I got curious
about what kind of people they are,

30:44.809 --> 30:47.764
and I took a peek at Team 3's personnel files.

30:50.434 --> 30:52.029
What a mess they were.

30:53.141 --> 30:56.226
Team Leader Moo still having a job
is a miracle.

30:56.226 --> 30:59.529
Manager Cha dodging
a disciplinary hearing is plain luck.

30:59.529 --> 31:02.042
Assistant Manager Yoon sits
at rock bottom on peer reviews.

31:03.615 --> 31:05.925
I figured I'd have a quick word with HR

31:05.925 --> 31:09.699
and use this chance
to clean that team right out.

31:17.434 --> 31:19.419
How about it?

31:19.419 --> 31:21.301
Hit the right spot, didn't I?

31:21.301 --> 31:22.744
Your weak spot.

31:49.516 --> 31:51.830
You still bail when things get hard, huh?

31:52.499 --> 31:55.548
Living face to face like this just
isn't going to work anymore.

31:57.767 --> 31:58.947
Listen.

32:01.216 --> 32:03.049
I took you in because it was you.

32:03.049 --> 32:05.797
Showing up unexpectedly, with nowhere to go.

32:05.797 --> 32:07.430
Someone as proud as you,

32:07.430 --> 32:10.014
someone who hates showing any weakness,

32:10.014 --> 32:12.936
if she came to me, there had to be a reason.

32:12.936 --> 32:15.557
That's why I asked no questions and let you in.

32:16.725 --> 32:17.908
But hold on...

32:20.986 --> 32:23.486
Did you walk into this apartment
with a plan from day one?

32:23.486 --> 32:25.823
It's true that I had nowhere to go.

32:28.309 --> 32:30.643
Having a plan is also partly true.

32:39.017 --> 32:41.016
This whole situation right now,

32:41.016 --> 32:43.860
it's not a good place
for Jeon Jae Yeol to be in either.

32:43.860 --> 32:46.203
He is the man you love, right?

32:46.203 --> 32:47.761
How could you do that if you love him?

32:47.761 --> 32:50.889
The love you describe
and the love I'm in must not be the same.

32:50.889 --> 32:53.028
I'm capable of going even further than this.

33:00.233 --> 33:02.036
Thanks for everything.

33:02.778 --> 33:04.060
Take care of yourself.

33:28.301 --> 33:30.888
[Joo In Ah]

33:44.892 --> 33:46.142
Hey.

33:46.142 --> 33:47.450
Hey.

33:54.454 --> 33:56.060
Ki Jun.

33:57.455 --> 33:58.763
You doing okay?

34:12.725 --> 34:14.614
Am I heavy on you?

34:16.040 --> 34:17.725
Light as a feather.

34:17.725 --> 34:19.929
Honestly, way too light.

34:21.148 --> 34:23.132
I feel pretty heavy though.

34:23.975 --> 34:26.421
Do you hate carrying me
because I weigh too much?

34:27.195 --> 34:29.906
You're not actually heavy,

34:29.906 --> 34:32.177
but drinking like this makes me hate it.

34:34.850 --> 34:36.958
Don't hate me, please.

34:42.586 --> 34:45.880
Manager Cha still has to buy a house.

34:46.759 --> 34:50.419
And Team Leader Moo's kids
have college ahead of them.

34:51.332 --> 34:55.637
And Hae Young still has to marry her boyfriend.

34:58.476 --> 35:00.137
Are you crying right now?

35:01.561 --> 35:03.044
I'm not.

35:07.850 --> 35:09.325
By any chance,

35:10.559 --> 35:12.767
did Vice Chairman Jeon Seong Yeol

35:12.767 --> 35:14.942
put the squeeze on you over the team?

35:17.142 --> 35:18.466
Honestly,

35:20.255 --> 35:22.545
forget being some impregnable fortress,

35:25.378 --> 35:28.232
I feel like I have turned
into a rotted-out fence.

36:16.293 --> 36:18.046
This is Noh Ki Jun.

36:18.046 --> 36:19.716
Could we talk for a moment?

36:43.830 --> 36:45.513
Care for a drink?

36:45.513 --> 36:46.541
I'll pass,

36:46.541 --> 36:47.896
since I drove here.

36:57.184 --> 36:58.605
Is In Ah...

36:59.725 --> 37:01.222
doing alright?

37:01.222 --> 37:02.980
If you're that worried about her,

37:04.100 --> 37:05.725
shouldn't you be putting your head

37:05.725 --> 37:08.156
into figuring out
how to clean up this mess instead?

37:11.226 --> 37:13.725
The IP that the company traced

37:13.725 --> 37:15.236
came back to my apartment.

37:15.236 --> 37:17.351
I know this wasn't your doing.

37:18.197 --> 37:19.818
I'll take the fall and say it was me.

37:24.655 --> 37:27.665
That I held a grudge over being shoved
down to PM and framed her.

37:27.665 --> 37:29.577
That's what I'll testify
at the disciplinary hearing.

37:29.577 --> 37:31.127
I cannot allow that.

37:31.127 --> 37:33.433
So we go with the truth then?

37:33.433 --> 37:35.659
Out Ah Jeong as the one who did it?

37:35.659 --> 37:37.717
How Ah Jeong feels about you,

37:37.717 --> 37:39.908
what was between you and In Ah,

37:41.304 --> 37:42.432
every bit of it will come spilling out.

37:42.432 --> 37:44.948
Still, what's wrong is wrong.

37:44.948 --> 37:46.829
Let's pretend this conversation never happened.

37:51.358 --> 37:52.800
Sir.

37:56.767 --> 37:59.165
Every bit of this is for the Head's sake.

38:05.226 --> 38:08.392
The disciplinary will land on you.

38:08.392 --> 38:09.907
That makes no difference to me.

38:10.750 --> 38:14.434
Compared to the humiliation and disgrace
the Head would face otherwise,

38:14.434 --> 38:17.298
this is a much lighter burden to bear.

38:17.298 --> 38:18.680
And honestly...

38:19.934 --> 38:23.032
I've never cared about this company
the way she does.

38:52.493 --> 38:53.518
It's me.

38:53.518 --> 38:57.424
You heard the hearing is at three today, right?

38:57.424 --> 38:58.884
I did.

38:58.884 --> 39:01.759
We're taking the witness testimony first,

39:01.759 --> 39:03.749
so come in by four.

39:03.749 --> 39:05.209
A witness?

39:06.431 --> 39:08.630
What kind of witness testimony?

39:10.734 --> 39:12.186
The one who spread the email

39:12.186 --> 39:15.039
has agreed to admit the whole thing was a lie.

39:15.940 --> 39:17.775
And who exactly is that?

39:17.775 --> 39:19.490
[Noh Ki Jun]

39:20.850 --> 39:25.185
The phone is turned off.
You're being connected to voicemail...

39:31.017 --> 39:33.210
This is the best move we have.

39:33.210 --> 39:35.184
So all I need from you

39:35.184 --> 39:38.277
is the order to call me
into the disciplinary hearing.

39:44.010 --> 39:45.636
You sent for me, Vice Chairman?

39:45.636 --> 39:48.517
Head Joo's hearing is today, right?

39:48.517 --> 39:51.934
Yes, it's about to start any minute,

39:51.934 --> 39:54.314
but there's no need for you
to attend in person.

39:54.314 --> 39:55.525
No.

39:57.484 --> 39:59.088
I'll be sitting in too.

40:01.683 --> 40:04.114
We will now begin the disciplinary hearing

40:04.114 --> 40:06.885
regarding Head of Audit Joo In Ah.

40:06.885 --> 40:10.578
This committee is here to determine
whether Head Joo violated company policy

40:10.578 --> 40:14.403
through improper conduct in her personal life.

40:14.403 --> 40:16.267
Before hearing from Head Joo herself,

40:16.267 --> 40:19.767
we will first hear testimony
from a witness present today

40:19.767 --> 40:23.090
regarding the email in question,
Assistant Manager Noh Ki Jun.

40:23.090 --> 40:25.384
Nobody briefed me on this beforehand,

40:25.384 --> 40:27.220
so what is Mr. Noh doing here?

40:27.220 --> 40:30.100
My apologies for the lack of advance notice.

40:30.100 --> 40:32.099
The IT team in HR

40:32.099 --> 40:36.020
ran a trace on the sender IP behind the email.

40:36.020 --> 40:38.660
As a result, the sender of the email

40:38.660 --> 40:40.752
regarding Head Joo In Ah is...

40:49.200 --> 40:52.674
Hold on, Head Joo,
you were told to come in by four.

40:53.518 --> 40:55.330
I'll take responsibility.

41:03.975 --> 41:05.844
I'll own this entire mess and...

41:05.844 --> 41:07.416
It's me.

41:14.346 --> 41:16.313
The man in that photo,

41:16.313 --> 41:17.502
that was me.

41:22.333 --> 41:24.072
Hold on, really...

41:25.518 --> 41:27.073
What's the history between you two?

41:27.073 --> 41:30.330
Head Joo and I used to be
in a relationship some time ago.

41:31.267 --> 41:33.518
But ever since we broke up and I got married,

41:33.518 --> 41:36.554
nothing improper has ever happened between us.

41:38.502 --> 41:40.570
So what about that scene then?

41:40.570 --> 41:42.078
Care to explain?

41:48.809 --> 41:51.226
That was entirely on me.

41:53.932 --> 41:56.434
After seeing her again after so long,

41:56.434 --> 41:58.476
feelings I didn't even know

41:58.476 --> 42:00.934
were still buried in me came rushing back,

42:00.934 --> 42:03.000
and I slipped up.

42:04.277 --> 42:06.421
If anything,
she's the one who got hurt by this.

42:07.732 --> 42:09.825
Head Joo

42:09.825 --> 42:13.914
never did anything inappropriate herself.

42:29.884 --> 42:31.218
No way.

42:31.809 --> 42:34.196
With Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol?

42:35.348 --> 42:37.142
Unbelievable,

42:37.142 --> 42:38.730
my head is starting to spin.

42:38.730 --> 42:41.451
Honestly, our Head plays
in a whole different league.

42:41.451 --> 42:42.563
The Vice Chairman himself.

42:42.563 --> 42:44.791
But still, they said there was
nothing improper between them.

42:44.791 --> 42:47.496
The Vice Chairman admitted
he still has feelings for her.

42:47.496 --> 42:48.711
Doesn't that count as cheating too?

42:48.711 --> 42:50.751
How is that even cheating?

42:50.751 --> 42:53.050
Emotional cheating still counts as cheating.

42:53.050 --> 42:56.239
If my boyfriend told me
he was hung up on his ex,

42:56.239 --> 42:57.569
I'd dump him on the spot.

42:57.569 --> 42:59.413
Still, unless they took it that far physically,

42:59.413 --> 43:01.059
you can't strictly call it cheating.

43:01.059 --> 43:02.583
Come on, they made a move already.

43:02.583 --> 43:03.689
The hug.

43:03.689 --> 43:05.628
And with a photo
like that out there in the open,

43:05.628 --> 43:07.007
who knows how much further it went...

43:07.007 --> 43:08.261
It went nowhere further.

43:10.600 --> 43:13.597
What are you two still
doing standing around here?

43:13.597 --> 43:15.891
Why are you always camped out
in someone else's area yapping?

43:15.891 --> 43:17.765
If you want to be here that bad,
just apply to Team 3.

43:17.765 --> 43:19.051
You're here every single day,

43:19.051 --> 43:21.948
I can't even tell
whose team you belong to anymore.

43:24.274 --> 43:26.161
About Audit Team...

43:32.642 --> 43:34.615
Honestly, the Vice Chairman,

43:34.615 --> 43:36.762
he hogs every heroic moment for himself.

43:39.245 --> 43:41.934
You tried to lie at a disciplinary hearing
just to look like a hero?

43:43.040 --> 43:44.560
I heard everything.

43:44.560 --> 43:46.085
That you sent the email,

43:46.085 --> 43:49.260
and you were ready
to swear it was a malicious lie.

43:49.260 --> 43:52.010
I thought this was the best move
in this situation.

43:52.010 --> 43:55.302
With you taking that kind
of ridiculous threat from above,

43:55.302 --> 43:57.120
just standing on the sidelines was unbearable.

43:57.120 --> 44:00.351
If you confessed to something
you never did because of me,

44:00.351 --> 44:02.877
did you really think
I'd just sit there and watch?

44:04.186 --> 44:06.483
This was the only card I had to play,

44:06.483 --> 44:09.963
so I'd take even this path to keep you safe.

44:17.683 --> 44:20.009
I should stop
letting myself fall apart so easily.

44:20.009 --> 44:22.369
I'm going to end up wrecking you.

44:24.665 --> 44:25.870
Why is that?

44:25.870 --> 44:27.751
I liked it when you reached out to me
because you were struggling.

44:27.751 --> 44:29.415
Climbing onto my back just like that.

44:38.415 --> 44:40.820
- What is it?
- Give me a second.

44:40.820 --> 44:41.891
Where are you off to?

44:41.891 --> 44:43.267
Don't come after me.

44:51.518 --> 44:54.028
What is going on all of a sudden?

44:54.028 --> 44:55.938
Are you really quitting?

44:56.600 --> 44:58.478
Just overnight, like this?

44:59.077 --> 45:02.204
What am I supposed to do here
all alone without you?

45:05.083 --> 45:06.384
Take care.

45:13.258 --> 45:14.627
Hey.

45:43.311 --> 45:45.548
At least you seem to know

45:45.548 --> 45:47.416
that you had it coming.

45:51.931 --> 45:53.392
What made you do it?

45:55.392 --> 45:57.197
I couldn't stand the sight,

45:57.833 --> 45:59.384
of any of you.

46:01.608 --> 46:03.041
Clear enough.

46:03.774 --> 46:05.454
So are you satisfied?

46:05.454 --> 46:08.146
- With where things stand now?
- I don't regret a thing.

46:08.146 --> 46:10.104
That precious love of yours,

46:10.104 --> 46:12.166
it's been wrecked enough for me.

46:16.365 --> 46:18.494
You've gone and wrecked yourself too.

46:20.112 --> 46:21.658
Take a hard look,

46:22.327 --> 46:24.486
at who actually fell apart here.

46:31.834 --> 46:34.339
Do you have a brain in your head?

46:34.339 --> 46:36.197
Why on earth would you step up like that?

46:36.797 --> 46:38.593
I'm doing what I can to kill the press,
no need to worry.

46:38.593 --> 46:40.465
Keep your mouth shut, you!

46:40.465 --> 46:42.699
How do you think
your in-laws are going to react?

46:42.699 --> 46:45.000
What are you going to do
if they push for divorce?

46:46.178 --> 46:47.742
There's actually something

46:48.434 --> 46:50.601
I've been meaning to bring up.

46:51.645 --> 46:52.961
Who's there?

46:55.694 --> 46:57.250
It's me.

46:59.445 --> 47:00.459
It's you.

47:00.459 --> 47:02.017
Hello.

47:02.017 --> 47:03.018
Hyun Young.

47:03.018 --> 47:04.492
You're here too.

47:08.028 --> 47:10.292
I caught all of it from outside.

47:10.292 --> 47:12.850
Are you very upset?

47:12.850 --> 47:15.683
Of course you're upset.

47:15.683 --> 47:18.130
My father has been reading
my brother the riot act,

47:18.130 --> 47:19.226
so please go easy on him.

47:19.226 --> 47:21.553
No, I'm completely fine actually.

47:21.553 --> 47:23.847
I already knew everything.

47:23.847 --> 47:25.759
What was going on between Head Joo and him.

47:26.510 --> 47:28.939
I'm the one who told him to step up like a man.

47:29.728 --> 47:32.481
Sitting on his hands while his ex was
getting battered like that,

47:32.481 --> 47:34.236
that would have been so embarrassing.

47:36.523 --> 47:38.336
Look how cool you play this.

47:38.336 --> 47:41.226
You really lucked out on the marriage front.

47:41.226 --> 47:42.879
Of course.

47:42.879 --> 47:44.688
I'm a Sesan woman, after all.

47:49.476 --> 47:51.524
Setting that aside,

47:52.247 --> 47:56.004
about the development project
with CPK coming up,

47:56.004 --> 47:59.171
what do you think about Sesan
joining the consortium on our end?

47:59.171 --> 48:00.926
This is what you wanted to bring up?

48:01.530 --> 48:03.690
Does Chairman Oh know about this too?

48:03.690 --> 48:04.930
He does.

48:04.930 --> 48:07.394
My father said we should go big on the scale.

48:08.213 --> 48:10.391
With Sesan's capital and Haemu's tech,

48:10.391 --> 48:13.505
we could break free
from CPK's grip to some extent.

48:13.505 --> 48:15.453
Right.

48:15.453 --> 48:17.725
Alright, first things first,

48:17.725 --> 48:18.860
let's set up a meeting with Chairman Oh...

48:18.860 --> 48:21.850
There is one condition though.

48:28.934 --> 48:31.803
At this shareholders meeting, you publicly

48:33.080 --> 48:34.553
name my husband

48:35.210 --> 48:37.655
as the next head of the group,

48:38.612 --> 48:41.639
as "Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol."

48:58.616 --> 48:59.690
What are you trying to pull?

48:59.690 --> 49:01.820
I'm offering to help you out.

49:01.820 --> 49:04.217
- So you can grab the succession seat.
- That's exactly my question, why?

49:05.226 --> 49:06.280
I already told you.

49:06.280 --> 49:07.701
That you want a divorce?

49:09.592 --> 49:11.029
Is that why you made

49:11.029 --> 49:13.546
such a romantic declaration
out there in front of everyone?

49:14.848 --> 49:16.959
- That was...
- This is hilarious.

49:17.642 --> 49:19.123
Hold on a second.

49:20.213 --> 49:22.825
My dopamine is through the roof right now.

49:23.964 --> 49:27.190
To think you had that kind of devotion in you,

49:28.388 --> 49:30.636
it's actually so fascinating, you know?

49:31.725 --> 49:33.214
I have to say,

49:34.352 --> 49:36.308
I no longer want to let you go.

49:40.567 --> 49:42.159
Hold on, am I...

49:42.900 --> 49:44.839
Am I in love with you?

49:49.934 --> 49:51.903
- Oh Hyun Young.
- Honey.

49:53.683 --> 49:55.434
Darling,

49:55.434 --> 50:00.107
you really aren't in any position
to push back against me right now.

50:00.107 --> 50:03.545
What I just did saved more than you alone.

50:03.545 --> 50:05.980
It pulled Joo In Ah out of the fire too.

50:07.683 --> 50:09.793
You do want her saved,

50:11.370 --> 50:12.770
right?

50:44.725 --> 50:46.017
Oh my,

50:46.017 --> 50:48.215
isn't life at our company
a total blast these days?

50:48.215 --> 50:51.139
The Vice Chairman himself
serving up a rebound romance?

50:51.767 --> 50:54.304
Joo In Ah is such a hypocrite though.

50:54.304 --> 50:57.414
The nerve, running audits
while dating the Vice Chairman.

50:57.414 --> 50:59.438
They said it isn't a current thing though.

50:59.438 --> 51:00.695
It was a past thing.

51:00.695 --> 51:03.814
Who knows about that either.

51:03.814 --> 51:07.025
Anyway, Joo In Ah always felt fishy to me.

51:07.025 --> 51:08.485
The fast-track promotions and all,

51:08.485 --> 51:10.696
she has that "face that lures men in" look.

51:10.696 --> 51:11.810
Oh dear,

51:12.489 --> 51:14.563
was that meant as an insult or a compliment?

51:14.563 --> 51:17.244
- Ma'am... I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.

51:17.244 --> 51:18.328
So sorry.

51:18.328 --> 51:20.372
I'm asking out of genuine curiosity,

51:20.372 --> 51:23.120
what does that "face that lures men in" thing
actually mean?

51:23.834 --> 51:24.901
Hey.

51:25.547 --> 51:27.922
Let it slide, they aren't worth the energy.

51:29.968 --> 51:31.592
Let me grab you a morning coffee.
Iced americano?

51:31.592 --> 51:33.039
I'm good.

51:33.039 --> 51:35.850
I'll buy my own, double shot, extra strong,

51:35.850 --> 51:38.176
something to jolt me awake before heading up,

51:38.775 --> 51:40.965
so head upstairs without me.

51:51.559 --> 51:53.351
- Morning.
- Morning.

51:53.351 --> 51:54.715
You're here.

51:56.199 --> 51:59.215
What is so entertaining
that everyone keeps gossiping about the Head?

51:59.215 --> 52:00.621
Got nothing better to do?

52:00.621 --> 52:02.830
Will the Head even show up today?

52:02.830 --> 52:04.211
Were it me, walking in here
would feel pretty rough.

52:04.211 --> 52:05.767
What's there to feel awkward about?

52:05.767 --> 52:07.252
After the Vice Chairman's
declaration yesterday,

52:07.252 --> 52:09.396
our Head got her name completely cleared.

52:09.396 --> 52:10.926
Exactly,

52:10.926 --> 52:13.518
it really felt like he did that on purpose,

52:13.518 --> 52:15.624
my heart fluttered a little.

52:15.624 --> 52:16.864
Fluttered?

52:16.864 --> 52:20.740
Yesterday you were going off
about emotional cheating and whatnot.

52:26.809 --> 52:28.577
You holding up okay?

52:33.434 --> 52:34.584
Me?

52:40.476 --> 52:44.334
Hello, Joo In Ah here,
your rising topic of the hour.

52:47.546 --> 52:51.022
Dull office life got a little spicy
these past few days, didn't it?

52:52.142 --> 52:54.309
Alright then.

52:54.309 --> 52:57.264
We are switching back into work mode now.

52:57.264 --> 52:59.539
The shareholders meeting
is right around the corner.

52:59.539 --> 53:02.474
Mr. Ahn, bring me
the Audit Committee report please.

53:02.474 --> 53:03.840
On it.

53:07.646 --> 53:09.439
[Head of Audit]

53:09.439 --> 53:11.269
[Joo In Ah]

53:16.725 --> 53:18.225
Dad,

53:18.225 --> 53:22.077
you can't just hand him the succession
just because Sesan tells you to.

53:22.077 --> 53:23.102
[Jeon Seong Yeol]
If my brother takes over,

53:23.102 --> 53:25.413
Sesan will have us wrapped around their finger.

53:25.413 --> 53:26.793
Quiet, boy.

53:26.793 --> 53:29.173
This is entirely my call to make.

53:29.173 --> 53:30.752
Dad,

53:30.752 --> 53:32.309
with this current scandal hanging over him,

53:32.309 --> 53:34.131
my brother has
absolutely zero standing left here.

53:34.131 --> 53:36.138
His public image is in total ruins...

53:47.138 --> 53:50.700
Why? Why him?

53:58.518 --> 54:00.036
Who is it?

54:02.683 --> 54:04.536
Should I come back later?

54:05.582 --> 54:07.022
Doo Gi.

54:16.142 --> 54:20.931
Regarding that Haemu Pharma case we discussed,

54:20.931 --> 54:24.848
while forensics was checking
Head Joo's computer,

54:24.848 --> 54:27.184
they discovered that the Haemu Pharma files

54:27.184 --> 54:29.519
had been permanently wiped from her drive.

54:29.519 --> 54:30.557
Joo In Ah did that?

54:30.557 --> 54:34.100
I don't have all the specific details yet,

54:34.100 --> 54:37.642
but since Vice Chairman Jeon ran Haemu Pharma,

54:37.642 --> 54:42.757
and given their romantic history together,

54:43.392 --> 54:46.594
connecting the dots leaves a really bad taste.

55:04.599 --> 55:06.559
Whatever it is,

55:06.559 --> 55:08.883
my brother must have them.

55:11.017 --> 55:13.234
Is there

55:13.234 --> 55:15.821
anyone on his side we can flip?

55:19.725 --> 55:21.905
The owner left it fully furnished,

55:21.905 --> 55:23.680
so it's ready for immediate move-in.

55:23.680 --> 55:26.391
You won't find a cheaper rent than this.

55:30.565 --> 55:32.110
I'll take the place.

55:33.524 --> 55:36.002
I can install a deadbolt myself, right?

55:36.002 --> 55:38.508
I'll let the landlord know right away.

55:38.508 --> 55:40.465
Since you're a young lady living alone,

55:40.465 --> 55:43.009
safety must be your top priority.

55:43.009 --> 55:46.570
Don't worry, this area is super peaceful.

55:46.570 --> 55:47.601
Perfect.

55:47.601 --> 55:49.811
I'll transfer the deposit right now.

55:49.811 --> 55:51.281
Sounds good.

55:58.528 --> 56:01.367
[Insufficient funds]

56:04.242 --> 56:07.734
- The number you have dialed...
- What kind of mess did he get into now?

56:15.975 --> 56:17.242
Hello?

56:17.919 --> 56:19.129
Is that you?

56:19.129 --> 56:20.515
Secretary Park?

56:27.767 --> 56:30.211
What is it you needed to say to me?

56:37.078 --> 56:40.150
About what was going on
between my brother and the Head of Audit,

56:40.150 --> 56:42.390
you had picked up on it, right?

56:43.698 --> 56:45.226
I mean,

56:45.226 --> 56:47.619
the timing of you stepping out
felt exactly like...

56:47.619 --> 56:49.859
someone who got pushed out
for speaking the truth.

56:54.559 --> 56:57.712
That isn't what got me out.

56:57.712 --> 57:00.382
Turns out the two of them
weren't only sharing feelings.

57:00.382 --> 57:03.296
There was fallout on the work side too.

57:03.296 --> 57:04.761
You really had no clue?

57:04.761 --> 57:07.139
I have no idea what you're getting at.

57:07.139 --> 57:10.796
That's exactly why I am digging
into the details right now,

57:13.184 --> 57:15.017
so I figured,

57:15.017 --> 57:18.241
couldn't I count on a little help from you?

57:22.901 --> 57:24.778
[2025 Haemu Group
General Meeting of Shareholders]

57:24.778 --> 57:28.398
[2025 Haemu Group
General Meeting of Shareholders]

57:59.312 --> 58:01.760
Why on earth are we the ones
sitting through the shareholders meeting?

58:01.760 --> 58:03.829
Other companies do the same thing,

58:03.829 --> 58:05.151
filling up the seats with their staff,
so move it.

58:05.151 --> 58:08.142
Coming from Team 1 the whole time,
you probably don't know this,

58:08.142 --> 58:11.659
but rounding up bodies for events like this
has always fallen to Team 3.

58:11.659 --> 58:13.518
Team 3 has always been the patch-up crew.

58:13.518 --> 58:15.027
Move it.

58:15.027 --> 58:18.300
That concludes
the financial audit report for this year.

58:23.708 --> 58:27.424
A special agenda item is
also lined up for today's meeting.

58:27.424 --> 58:30.635
Chairman Jeon Mu Tae
will be addressing it personally.

58:30.635 --> 58:32.722
The floor is yours, Chairman.

58:38.559 --> 58:41.605
I am well aware that opinions vary

58:41.605 --> 58:44.120
on Haemu Group's leadership
and business climate.

58:46.029 --> 58:50.251
I came here today to share a major decision

58:50.251 --> 58:51.636
regarding my position.

58:52.619 --> 58:54.826
Effective today, I, Jeon Mu Tae,

58:54.826 --> 58:56.634
am stepping down from the role of Chairman.

58:58.351 --> 58:59.831
The road ahead for Haemu Group

58:59.831 --> 59:03.175
will only bring fiercer competition.

59:03.922 --> 59:05.904
The person who leads Haemu Group

59:05.904 --> 59:08.835
must carry principle and resolve,

59:08.835 --> 59:12.558
and hold the organization steady
through any storm.

59:13.348 --> 59:14.971
To that end, the board has put forward...

59:14.971 --> 59:17.406
[Jeon Jae Yeol, Jeon Mu Tae]

59:17.406 --> 59:19.312
Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol

59:19.312 --> 59:22.150
as the nominee
for the third Chairman of Haemu Group.

59:24.046 --> 59:27.431
I ask for your wise judgment on this matter.

59:30.975 --> 59:32.572
Thank you, Chairman.

59:32.572 --> 59:35.033
Moving on, regarding the appointment
of Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol

59:35.033 --> 59:37.619
as the next Chairman,
before we proceed to a vote,

59:37.619 --> 59:41.267
we welcome any objections
or questions from the floor.

59:44.681 --> 59:45.714
If there are none...

59:45.714 --> 59:46.978
I have an objection.

59:51.198 --> 59:54.678
You are raising an objection right now

59:54.678 --> 59:56.806
to the Chairman appointment item, correct?

59:59.514 --> 01:00:01.605
That is correct.

01:00:01.605 --> 01:00:05.100
Vice Chairman Jeon Jae Yeol has no business
becoming the head of Haemu Group.

01:00:05.100 --> 01:00:06.431
The reason being,

01:00:08.494 --> 01:00:12.103
he did something he never should have done,
and that something...

01:00:15.164 --> 01:00:18.572
was buried for him by his former lover,
the Head of Audit.

01:00:19.828 --> 01:00:21.625
What are you saying?

01:00:21.625 --> 01:00:22.898
Do you have grounds for this?

01:00:22.898 --> 01:00:25.305
Of course, Father, grounds matter.

01:00:26.309 --> 01:00:28.628
That is why I brought in someone

01:00:28.628 --> 01:00:31.422
to testify firsthand about all of it.

01:00:32.176 --> 01:00:34.855
The person who knows the Vice Chairman

01:00:34.855 --> 01:00:37.157
better than anyone else.

01:02:50.351 --> 01:02:53.143
How much of Secretary Park's
bombshell is actually true?

01:02:53.143 --> 01:02:54.983
Take Joo In Ah down somehow.

01:02:54.983 --> 01:02:56.892
What kind of stunt are you pulling now?

01:02:56.892 --> 01:02:59.162
Just turn in your resignation.

01:03:00.113 --> 01:03:01.142
Ki Jun,

01:03:01.142 --> 01:03:02.240
[The femme fatale Head of Audit holding the key]
are you really the one

01:03:02.240 --> 01:03:03.241
she's dating?

01:03:03.241 --> 01:03:04.993
Wasn't it you who told me?

01:03:04.993 --> 01:03:08.079
To take a hard look
at who is actually falling apart.

01:03:08.079 --> 01:03:09.831
- Hey!
- It looks like Noh Ki Jun,

01:03:09.831 --> 01:03:11.416
is the one falling apart the most.

01:03:11.416 --> 01:03:12.584
I won't be settling on this.

01:03:12.584 --> 01:03:14.725
I'm going to protect her
all the way to the end.

01:03:15.545 --> 01:03:17.759
From here on out,
no matter what comes out of my mouth,

01:03:17.759 --> 01:03:20.147
it all means I love you.
